 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): sir, come and sit. i will take the bp, the cuff is a bit tight only.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): mm.",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): it is coming one-forty over ninety. pulse seventy-eight... no, eighty-two. you can go in.",
  "[SEG0004] person_3 (DOCTOR): ah, err, password again, this screen. sorry. what brings you?",
  "[SEG0005] person_2 (PATIENT): hands.",
  "[SEG0006] person_3 (DOCTOR): hands? say again, i was on the computer.",
  "[SEG0007] person_2 (PATIENT): numb.",
  "[SEG0008] person_3 (DOCTOR): numb where?",
  "[SEG0009] person_2 (PATIENT): right thumb, index, middle. at night.",
  "[SEG0010] person_3 (DOCTOR): sorry, say the fingers once more, i did not catch.",
  "[SEG0011] person_2 (PATIENT): thumb. index. middle.",
  "[SEG0012] person_3 (DOCTOR): only the right, is it?",
  "[SEG0013] person_2 (PATIENT): mostly.",
  "[SEG0014] person_3 (DOCTOR): work?",
  "[SEG0015] person_2 (PATIENT): factory. packing.",
  "[SEG0016] person_3 (DOCTOR): uh, the cursor went off. sorry. from how long, and you shake the hand or what?",
  "[SEG0017] person_2 (PATIENT): two months. no, three. i shake them awake.",
  "[SEG0018] person_3 (DOCTOR): dropping any cups?",
  "[SEG0019] person_2 (PATIENT): cups.",
  "[SEG0020] person_3 (DOCTOR): pain in the hand?",
  "[SEG0021] person_2 (PATIENT): no.",
  "[SEG0022] person_3 (DOCTOR): neck pain? legs going weak?",
  "[SEG0023] person_2 (PATIENT): no.",
  "[SEG0024] person_3 (DOCTOR): umm, what all tablets you take? the old file is not opening.",
  "[SEG0025] person_2 (PATIENT): amlodipin for the pressure, five milligram, morning. the cholesterol one at night, twenty milligram, no, ten. sugar tablets, metformine, five hundred, twice a day. only the ayurvedic powder in the morning.",
  "[SEG0026] person_3 (DOCTOR): sorry, that cholesterol one, ten or twenty? the screen blinked.",
  "[SEG0027] person_2 (PATIENT): ten.",
  "[SEG0028] person_3 (DOCTOR): the ayurvedic powder, what is the name?",
  "[SEG0029] person_2 (PATIENT): don't know.",
  "[SEG0030] person_3 (DOCTOR): hmm. one second, the cursor jumped. this is fitting carpal tunnel, median nerve, provisional, i am not confirming today.",
  "[SEG0031] person_3 (DOCTOR): get a night splint for the right wrist from the chemist. ease off the hard grip on the packing line. if it is not better in six weeks then we do the nerv conduction. if the cup dropping becomes more, come sooner.",
  "[SEG0032] person_2 (PATIENT): ok.",
  "[SEG0033] person_3 (DOCTOR): that is all from my side. you can go."
